      "text": "[9:25PM] #IyanaIpaja #TrafficUpdate \n\nGoye inward Danco on Lagos Abeoukuta Expressway is moving fine at the moment.\n\nSlow from Accessbank by Araromi up to Iyana Ipaja underneath the bridge.\nThe return journey is good.\n\nAlaagba ascending and descending the overhead bridge inward Iyana Ipaja roundabout is slow.\n\nIyana ipaja roundabout inward Baruwa junction through Mosalasi roundabout is good, return journey of same stretch down to Iyana Ipaja Roundabout is also good.\n\nMosalasi roundabout inward Isheri roundabout through Egbeda Intersection is also free, same as the return journey.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
