      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1954653787236294963",
      "text": "[10:13PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is flowing smoothly from Abule Ado through the Under Bridge, Volks, Afolabi Ege, and onward to Iyana Iba. However, the intersection is experiencing a moderate level of congestion due to the high volume of commercial activities in the area.\n\nThe vehicular movement from Iyana Iba intersection to Igando, traversing First Gate, Ipaye, Iyana School, and Obadore Bridge, is currently unhindered, with a similar seamless flow observed on the return journey to the intersection.\n\nMovement in and around Igbo Elerin is proceeding without any notable disruptions. Afolabi Ege Flyover link to LASU-Isheri Road is also clear, facilitating efficient travel.\n\nFurthermore, Badagry Expressway is witnessing good movement from Iyana Iba towards Agbara, passing through Igbo Elerin Junction, Iyana Isashi, and Iyana Era, all the way to the Custom checkpoint. Fortunately, there are no reported impediments to traffic flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
